# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #fields: the data scanner sees the direct root heads only, a root if: is one head if; a
# missing place is a runtime error of the call; next_core_tasks_v3.md N4-U U1): D declares y only inside its root if
# body, so D has no place y. The admission of call: S D fails when the program runs, before S runs: the implicit
# call throw, taken by catch: call. D\x keeps 1 although the first statement of S writes x. Entry 7.
S:
    int: x 9
    int: y 2
end: S
D:
    int: x 1
    if: x = 1
        int: y 0
end: D
fn: run () int
    int: r 82
    call: S D
    catch: call ()
        r: 83
        if: D\x = 1
            r: 7
    ---
return: r
int: got run()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: got; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
